{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Robbing Time\u00a0</strong>is an online coop horror heist game, where you and up to 4 of your friends will face mighty Superheroes standing between you and treasures in various locations. Use your connections in the corrupted prison to buy gadgets, upgrades and choose your mission. It's Robbing Time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Robbing Time</strong>\u00a0<strong>Demo</strong>\u00a0features the the introductory mission and main mission on the first level of the full game<strong>.</strong>\u00a0These missions will let you sample the gameplay systems of<strong>\u00a0Robbing Time</strong>\u00a0as well as the unlock the first couple of items in the Prison's Black Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821300/extras/Timeline_1.gif?t=1750699178\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gadgets:</strong> You only have 3 item slots. Choose what you carry wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heist:</strong>\u00a0Each location has a unique heist to pull off. Figure it out while the Superhero is on your tail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Communicate:</strong>\u00a0Use the proximity voice chat to coordinate with your team or use unique solo player advantages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821300/extras/gif2.gif?t=1750699178\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROBBERS VS SUPERHEROES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may defeat cops and security guards, but the only thing you can do against a Superhero is to hide or run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Robbing Time Demo</strong> features the game's first hero:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p 